description	"Cassus Fett 

A tactical leader with a heavy blaster pistol and a variety of support tech.

^2Weaponry:
- Heavy Melee
-- 15% Faster Movement
- Cassus' Vibroblade (Yellow/Red Saber)
-- No Blaster Block
-- 48% more Reach
-- 42% less Red Dmg
- Cassus' Heavy Blaster Pistol
-- Mando Pistol (2)
-- 45%+ Damage/20%- RoF/30%+ FP Drain/20%+ Velocity
-- Slows on Hit
- Colto Grenades (3)
-- Frag Grenades
-- 0% Damage, Heals on Hit
- Combat Stim Injector (Tracker Darts 6)
-- Heals on Inject

^8Attributes:
- 20% less Kb Taken
- Strength (1)
- Dexterity (1)
- Blast Armor
- Rally
- Beskar (2)
- Healing (1)
- Anti Mind Trick (2)
- Tracking Beacon
- Environmental Protection (1)

^3Abilities:
- Colto Sprayer (Health Dispenser 1) ^3[USE In Melee]
- DNA Scrambler (Wrist Laser) ^3[CS1]
-- Blinds, Poisons, Low Damage
- Mandolorian Armor Scanner (Enemy Scanner) ^3[CS2]
- Gun Kick ^3[CS3]
- Mandalorian Combat Shield ^3[CS4]
- Prime Tactics (Team Energize 1)
- Battle Focus (Force Rage 1)"
